x_vga16:  A server for 16 colour graphics modes. (Last one!)
x_vga16:
x_vga16:  This is the last in a long list of servers for XFree86 2.0. In most 
x_vga16:  cases you should only install the X server designed to work with your
x_vga16:  video hardware. 
x_vga16:
x_vga16:  Installing this package will create a link in /usr/X386/bin from
x_vga16:  XF86_VGA16 to X, setting this server as the default.
